//@ expect-stdout: LLM_PHASE12_FUSED_PASS
//
// Phase 12: Motor Soberano Fundido — Kernels, Fused Forward, Jacobian Conformal & Untied 2-Shard Parity
// Test 1: SIMD paged_gqa + paged_gqa_batch + tiled gemv_bf16 + gemm_bf16 CPU vs Metal parity.
// Test 2: Fused projections & norms: gemv_bf16_qkv, gemv_bf16_gate_up_swiglu, q4/q8_qkv_fast,
//         q4/q8_gate_up_swiglu, qk_norm_rope_kv_scatter, add_accum_rmsnorm (use_inv_rms=0 and 1).
// Test 3: Untied 2-shard /tmp/sounio_p11_multishard CPU vs Metal parity across
//         bf16 (mode 0), q4_conformal (mode 17) + Jacobian (c_add=12.5, use_inv_rms=true),
//         and q4_exact_scrub (mode 20 at q=0.0001 and q=10000.0).

